From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 01:57:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] soc: apple: sleep: keep s2idle the default on T8132
 for now

With every refusal on the way in fixed, a J604 deep sleep commits,
wakes at its alarm and then resets the SoC on the way back, before
apple_sleep_return(). Memory is lost:

  macsmc-reboot macsmc-reboot: previous boot: failed-boot stage 0xe3

With deep the default, a lid close or the session menu's suspend does
exactly that. Leave s2idle the default on T8132 and keep deep offered,
so that the sleep tests still select it through /sys/power/mem_sleep.
The default goes back to deep once a deep cycle returns with memory
kept.

Assisted-by: LLM
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
---
 drivers/soc/apple/sleep.c | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/apple/sleep.c b/drivers/soc/apple/sleep.c
index baf93f9e75..6d9bd3f5c5 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/apple/sleep.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/apple/sleep.c
@@ -441,6 +441,8 @@ struct apple_sleep_reg {
  * so, and the lists keep the order macOS was measured with.
  */
 struct apple_sleep_soc {
+	/* Deep is offered but not the default: no deep cycle has come back yet. */
+	bool s2idle_default;
 	const struct apple_sleep_reg *regs;
 	unsigned int nregs;
 	int (*commit)(unsigned long unused);
@@ -4153,6 +4155,9 @@ static int apple_sleep_probe(struct platform_device *pdev)
 	apple_sleep = s;
 	/* Deep becomes the default sleep state, unless mem_sleep_default= chose another. */
 	suspend_set_ops(&apple_sleep_ops);
+	/* Userspace may still pick deep through /sys/power/mem_sleep. */
+	if (s->soc->s2idle_default && mem_sleep_current == PM_SUSPEND_MEM)
+		mem_sleep_current = PM_SUSPEND_TO_IDLE;
 
 	dev_info(dev, "deep sleep %s: boot object resumes %llu\n",
 		 mem_sleep_current == PM_SUSPEND_MEM ? "is the default" :
@@ -4471,6 +4476,8 @@ static const struct apple_sleep_word t8132_gate_off[] = {
 };
 
 static const struct apple_sleep_soc t8132_sleep_soc = {
+	/* A J604 deep sleep commits, wakes at its alarm and resets on the way back. */
+	.s2idle_default = true,
 	.regs = t8132_sleep_regs,
 	.nregs = ARRAY_SIZE(t8132_sleep_regs),
 	.commit = t8132_sleep_commit,
-- 
2.43.0

